lete_source_no_retention_effect；这不是由 disposal_count==0 或匹配失败直接推断。第二，8fb 的省略句被保留为 elliptical_recipient_permission_residual，并按原文分别取得 employee、agent、representative 及未归类接收方原子；旧 G 仅从可复用角色原子组合员工和代理人许可，没有声称原文含有被省略的显式动词。8fb 的处置条款仍严格保持 IF REQUESTED 与 blank_source_deadline，不制造 Agreement termination。因冻结消费者不把 request_by 视为 nda-16 的 endpoint trigger，8fb 的该原生标签仍存在不可诚实消除的解释差异；本更新不修改 decision_functions、不伪造触发器，也不宣称完整英文语义或全来源完美。普通 Free 控制可独立吸收同样的完整来源观察和省略角色逻辑；其直接 Norm 能力不改变 C 中新 Norm 必须由 G 组合的约束。","reading_contracts":[],"renderers_json":"[{\"predicate\":\"emit_single_return_v3\",\"support_arguments\":[],\"support_from_queries\":[],\"support_from_terms\":[7],\"term\":[\"disposal_obligation\",[\"receiving_party\"],[\"return_to\",[\"acquired_material_v3\",{\"scalar_argument\":0},{\"scalar_argument\":1}],[\"disclosing_party\"]],[\"acquired_trigger_v3\",{\"scalar_argument\":2},{\"scalar_argument\":3},{\"scalar_argument\":1}],[\"acquired_exception_scope_v3\",{\"scalar_argument\":4},{\"scalar_argument\":5},{\"scalar_argument\":6}]]},{\"predicate\":\"emit_single_destroy_v3\",\"support_arguments\":[],\"support_from_queries\":[],\"support_from_terms\":[7],\"term\":[\"disposal_obligation\",[\"receiving_party\"],[\"destroy\",[\"acquired_material_v3\",{\"scalar_argument\":0},{\"scalar_argument\":1}]],[\"acquired_trigger_v3\",{\"scalar_argument\":2},{\"scalar_argument\":3},{\"scalar_argument\":1}],[\"acquired_exception_scope_v3\",{\"scalar_argument\":4},{\"scalar_argument\":5},{\"scalar_argument\":6}]]},{\"predicate\":\"emit_alternative_v3\",\"support_arguments\":[],\"support_from_queries\":[],\"support_from_terms\":[13,14,15],\"term\":[\"disposal_obligation\",[\"receiving_party\"],[\"acquired_action_alternative_v3\",[\"return_to\",[\"acquired_material_v3\",{\"scalar_argument\":0},{\"scalar_argument\":1}],[\"disclosing_party\"]],[\"destroy\",[\"acquired_material_v3\",{\"scalar_argument\":2},{\"scalar_argument\":3}]],{\"scalar_argument\":12}],[\"acquired_trigger_v3\",{\"scalar_argument\":4},{\"scal